# Copy-instead-of-overwrite artifacts. This volume has produced "name 2.ext"
# and extensionless "index 2" duplicates when the release tree could not be
# cleared; one such file reached a published MANIFEST.md. The assembler fails
# loudly on them, and these patterns keep any that appear outside its walk from
# being swept in by `git add -A`.
* 2
* 3
* 4
* 2.*
* 3.*
* 4.*
